\newlabel{fig:tank}{{3}{5}{From top to bottom: SHS dry- and wet-bulb temperatures with the in-tank CT reference; SHS minus tank-temperature residuals during periods with CT coverage; WXT and in-air RBR psychrometric specific humidity; and air pressure used in the psychrometric calculation with WXT pressure. Grey bands mark in-water periods; the green dashed line marks the June 30 plastic-wick change}{figure.caption.6}{}}
