\newlabel{fig:response}{{4}{6}{Wet-bulb temperature and psychrometric-RH trajectories aligned to each OUT event. Dots are observations and lines are exponential fits; labels list the OUT time and fitted time constant, or ``capped'' when the fit reached the upper bound. Fit windows run from OUT to $\min (\text {OUT}+25\,\text {min},\,\text {next IN})$}{figure.caption.7}{}}
